    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\n_No response_\n\n### qTox Version\n\n1.18.3\n\n### Commit Hash\n\nb7802b42dcf5f68474eb4d6db66c004e3ca50848\n\n### Toxcore Version\n\n0.2.20\n\n### Qt Version\n\n6.8.1\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start qTox\n2. Go to user profile\n3. Try to scan Tox ID\n4. Fail!\n\n### Observed Behavior\n\nThe phone doesn't scan the QR code appropriately. When generated on another QR code generator, the text is able to be scanned. The QR code also has a much higher resolution.\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nThe QR code scans, and I can put someone's information into qTox\n\n### Reproducibility\n\nAlways\n\n### Operating System\n\nWindows\n\n### Operating System version/distro/name/etc.\n\nWindows 10\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\n\n```",
